# Agent Console Backend

Async FastAPI backend for the MVP agent console. It persists tools, subagent templates, supervisor configs, UI component state, and run history in PostgreSQL.

## Stack

- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy async + `asyncpg`
- Alembic
- PostgreSQL / pgvector image

## Environment

Create `.env` in the repo root:

```env
APP_TOOL_SCAN_PACKAGES=["app.tools"]
DEEP_AGENT_PG_HOST=127.0.0.1
DEEP_AGENT_PG_PORT=5432
DEEP_AGENT_PG_USER=postgres
DEEP_AGENT_PG_PASSWORD=postgres
DEEP_AGENT_PG_DATABASE=postgres
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=...
DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL=http://10.1.4.214:3000/v1
DASHSCOPE_MODEL=qwen3.5-plus
```

## Run

```bash
alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head
uvicorn app.main:app --app-dir backend --reload
```

## Main endpoints

- `GET /api/tools`
- `POST /api/tools/refresh`
- `GET /api/subagents`
- `POST /api/subagents`
- `GET /api/supervisors`
- `POST /api/supervisors`
- `POST /api/supervisors/{id}/validate`
- `POST /api/supervisors/{id}/generate`
- `POST /api/supervisors/{id}/run`
- `GET /api/ui-state`

## Notes

- Tools are discovered through `app_tool(...)`, which wraps the LangChain `@tool` decorator and attaches `namespace` plus registry metadata.
- Runtime execution persists run records and uses a LangChain chat model created from DashScope OpenAI-compatible settings.
